WEBVTT

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.400
Shu!

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:19.830
Sharon?

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.040
Not letting you!

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:17.050
Kisa... ra...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.160
Kisara... Can it be that her memories—

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:08.620
EPISODE 13
UNRESOLVED GRAND FINALE

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.780
They're not back.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.080
Ayano...

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.330
If they were, she'd never have saved me.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.330
No, I don't think she hated you that much.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.170
In any case, you have to ask her
what's the meaning of all this.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:22.340
After we all survive this battle together.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.770
Are you okay, Kisara?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:38.610
Oh...

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:43.110
So, it really isn't like
you remembered stuff about me.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.160
I-I'm sorry.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.620
I-I came here because, um, w-well...

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.790
Listen up, Kisara.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.920
That's my little sister.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.630
Little sister?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.880
So, I want to capture her alive.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.340
How should we...

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.220
We'll use your sword.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:09.560
By piercing her heart with that sword,
we can seal her away while still alive.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.850
There's no mistake about that?

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.270
Yeah, there's no mistake.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.360
Because...

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.740
that's what had happened to you.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.120
You're a little sister
with quite the busy hands!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.050
I'll persuade her later.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.150
I'm sorry, Kanna.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.210
It's working? Why so suddenly...

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.000
Maybe she's out of gas.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.590
I-I see. Because she's been fighting
for many hours already.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:25.090
This isn't good.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.350
Oh...

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.520
Huh? What's wrong?

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.190
Don't go, Kisara!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.600
Huh?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.210
Demons?

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.710
All hands, shoot them all down!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.630
Deal with them before they enter the city!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.220
Perhaps she can't keep holding back
due to the damage.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.720
That doesn't mean we can go easy on her.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.220
We have to defeat both of them!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.180
<i>Hey! At this rate, they'll end up
landing in the City! Do something!</i>

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.100
It's all because you overworked
the other companies!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.900
<i>They got sick of you guys
running out of control and parted ways!</i>

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.860
This isn't the time
to be talking about that.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.660
Unfortunately...

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.580
you'll need a passport
to go any farther from here!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.420
Follow the orders of the Immigration Bureau!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.170
Why, this is—

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.500
<i>So, there you have it, Akino.</i>

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.380
<i>All of us will protect it together.
It's our city.</i>

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.670
Dominic...

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.880
<i>You guys... Why...</i>

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:53.140
<i>We don't have a place to live on dry land.</i>

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:58.480
<i>Our home, our work, our graves
are all in this cradle floating in the ocean.</i>

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.270
<i>If so, protecting it is the only way.</i>

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.730
<i>I'm after money though!</i>

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:05.770
<i>I'm counting on a special bonus,
Director General!</i>

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.320
<i>Yeah, let's look forward to it!</i>

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.990
<i>- Huh? Hey, wait a minute!
- Time to rake in some money!</i>

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.530
<i>Don't decide on your own!</i>

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.030
<i>Hey, are you guys listening?</i>

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:15.870
In the end, when push comes to shove,
a long-standing relationship does all the talking.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.660
<i>It's all because I didn't hesitate to pay up!</i>

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:22.790
As I said, this isn't the time
to be saying such things!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.630
<i>Ayano, Sister...</i>

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.300
<i>You guys should head over there
as backup, as well.</i>

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.630
Got it.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.390
We can't fight that thing
with our equipment anymore anyway.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.010
So there you have it, Shu.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.890
Your family should do something
about your little sister's carelessness!

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:43.810
<i>And promptly at that before she disperses
any more demons out there!</i>

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.270
Got it.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:48.610
<i>Hey, isn't that a weird
definition of family?</i>

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:52.530
<i>Stop being jealous without thinking about
the place and the situation. Come on, let's go!</i>

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:53.360
<i>Hold on!</i>

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.120
<i>Let go of me, Sharon!</i>

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.450
And that's how it goes.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.790
We'll hold down Kanna by ourselves.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.460
You don't have to hold back at all.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.800
She's quite the tomboy.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.210
I know.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.800
She'll get me if I let my guard down.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.140
Can you do it?

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.970
I don't know.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.100
Because right now I'm...

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.980
not even sure about who I am.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:26.520
Do you want...

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.110
power?

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.110
Right now,

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.030
I want courage
more than power.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.240
Gotcha.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.650
I'm counting on you, Kisara.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.120
We're gonna settle the score by ourselves!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.750
Fire, fire, fire!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.580
We don't borrow powers of a demon
to fulfill our desires!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.340
We fulfill our desires
by defeating demons!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.800
That way, we have
more ways to spend money!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.800
Can't you guys be
a bit more stoic about this?

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:01.950
Over here, Kisara!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.620
Bring her here!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.760
Well then, let's go.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.020
To where your beloved big brother is.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.690
I'm sorry, Kanna.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.250
Kanna!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:14.940
Huh?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.710
Kisara?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:44.720
You stay here
and look after your little sister.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:03.030
We somehow managed
to get through all that.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.830
But can we hold our heads up high for this?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:12.410
The Plant is completely destroyed. And we failed
to keep everything out as a tiny bit made it to the city.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.790
We did everything we could.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:22.010
And not just the city.
Damages to my company were huge, as well.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:25.140
I lost all of my tools of the trade.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.890
In any case, we had no civilian casualties.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:32.230
Can't we hold our head
up high as our result?

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:37.610
If we're gonna hold our head up high, perhaps
it's finally time to accept that thing as one of us.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:46.370
After all, we ended up
completely relying on a demon's powers.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.910
You still remember how to fight.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:58.630
I don't have to think about anything.
My body moves on its own.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:02.800
Even after losing all your memories,
you still continue to be a threat.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.340
Will the Abbey still be targeting Kisara?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.220
As for the Abbey...

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.010
yeah.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:13.730
They won't give up
until she's exterminated.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.480
And what about you?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.490
At the very least, don't make me work
any more than this today.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.240
What should I do from now on?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.490
This seems to be a human society.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.540
And yet, apparently, I'm a demon.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.540
Because of that,
my life is occasionally in danger.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:43.510
Does this world have a place for me?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:55.230
You don't have to worry about that at all.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.740
Big Brother...

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.600
It seems the city has suffered
quite a bit of damage.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.810
Right.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:37.980
As much as this government does,
this may signal a crisis for its autonomy.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.480
We'll see about that.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.820
I don't think those folks
will quietly step down.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.070
Four countries and the Celestial Abbey.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.990
A total of five groups had six battleships
and 23 fighter jets aiming at this city.

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.000
If it took 30 more minutes
to suppress that thing,

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.080
perhaps Bayron City
would've evaporated from the map.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:04.130
But that didn't happen.
In other words, this is our victory.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:09.550
We're gonna be on a bed of nails
for a while after this.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:16.310
Overseas media and multiple governments will
press us hard to take responsibility for this incident.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.730
And the cover-ups for past stuff, too.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.810
If Father's head isn't enough...

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.900
then we can give them yours, my sisters.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.690
When that happens, I'll take over
and protect the autonomy of the City.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:35.660
We're fortunate to have a little brother who says
something so selfish with absolutely no shame.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.830
It's all right.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:41.830
Just in case something like this happened,
I've been gathering support from the people.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.420
It's finally time...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.250
for the school favorite Mikhail-senpai...

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.840
to make his long-awaited political entrance!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.550
That conclusion is the only fatal mistake.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.020
It's boring.

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:07.480
Well, we thoroughly
trounced Asmodeus there,

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.860
so it shouldn't interfere
with our world for a while.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.150
What about Kanna?

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.530
She's been sealed away
in the lowest level of the City Hall.

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:21.370
I do feel bad for her, but she's the gate
that connects us and the Demon World.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:24.540
He risked his life to save her.

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.710
Shu must be rolling in his grave.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.630
Oh no, he's still alive.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.630
I didn't think you'd contact me.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:39.560
After all, I thought I should say goodbye to you
as we put our lives on the line and fought together.

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.100
We did try to kill each other
while we were at it though.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.900
Are you going back to the Abbey?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.770
I am a nun after all.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.190
But you'll be...

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.860
Yeah. I'll face an inquisition when I return.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:56.660
After all, I fell a step behind
in my mission to defeat Asmodeus,

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.280
then continued to collude
with the enemy...

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:02.410
leaving the city with no visible results.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.000
And you're still going back?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.590
Oh, they won't be killing me.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:13.880
It's not like they have that much of a surplus
in manpower at the Abbey.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.430
More like you should be worried
about what's going to happen after I leave.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:27.810
The next guy the Abbey sends this way
may not be as soft as me, you hear?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.360
That's something
the actual target has to worry about.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:38.030
So, well, I think it's better for the both of us
to not see each other ever again.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.160
W-Wait!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:43.330
You're not going to see Shu?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.120
I did.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.210
I was with him in a hotel
until this morning.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.420
That was a joke.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.300
I'm not as bad at letting go as you are.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.220
Never come back here, you wench!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:09.400
It's all over, Dad, Mom.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:18.200
Well, both of your honor hasn't been revived
at all and Kanna is still captured,

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.410
so it's far from the ending I wanted.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.370
But this is the beginning.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.620
We'll slowly uncover the truth...

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.920
and gradually raise Kanna as a human.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.430
MILES MORGAN

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.230
Are you done?

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.610
It was okay for you to come, too.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.780
Right now, I don't have anything
to talk about with them.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.200
I see.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.790
That's why I want you to teach me...

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:11.250
all of the memories I've lost.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.040
Right.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:18.590
The good things and the bad things.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.590
The fun times and the sad times.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.470
Who you are, how you met me...

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.480
and how we ended up in this relationship.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.980
Yeah, I understand.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:39.280
I'll tell you bit by bit
over a long period of time.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.780
We have all the time in the world.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.790
You'll stop by, right?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:52.500
I don't need to eat a meal
or sleep on a bed.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:57.000
I told you that we'll talk a lot.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.300
Welcome home.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.430
Um, hold on!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:07.390
If you don't want to, you can say so.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.520
It's not that I don't want to.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.290
Contact the director general right away!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.370
Hurry up and find her!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.040
How many times
have you escaped this month?

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:41.380
I mean, I'm worried that some pesky bug
is going to be bothering my big brother.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.300
And it turns out I'm right.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.560
This must be divine guidance.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.430
Wait, it's not a good thing
for you guys to be believing in God.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:54.690
You should grow up already, Kanna.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:59.530
Why can't you realize
that you're robbing him of his freedom?

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.940
Come on, Kisara, calm down.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:05.570
The fact that you're super soft on her
like that is making her conceited!

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.530
Why are you acting like you're his wife?

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.910
This is my big brother's home to begin with,
so you're the outsider, aren't you?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.910
BEAN SPROUTS

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:17.540
You really became quite chatty!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.630
You could barely growl
until a few days ago!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:26.090
And each time you open your mouth,
it's "Shu this, Shu that"! You're always in heat!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:26.090
Jeez! Someone do something about these two!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.600
Stop resisting, Kanna!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:31.640
The one who came
is the person who can do the least!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.560
I understand that humans
are no match against you,

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.940
but by acting so selfishly,
you're troubling all those staffers!

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.320
Ayano, you stay quiet!

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:45.070
This is a problem between us!

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:45.860
Whaaa...

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.070
Which one did you come
to capture, Ayano?

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:54.960
See? I can't leave my precious big brother
to an audacious, demonic woman like her.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.080
I-I have to agree with that.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.960
But she's a demon, too!

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.460
Hey, calm down, all three of you—

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.130
Big Brother, whose side are you on?

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:03.880
Huh?

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:09.510
U-Um, well...

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:11.220
Let's see...

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.070
Can I withdraw already?

00:23:54.990 --> 00:24:00.000
THANK YOU
FOR WATCHING!

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:59.120
Thank you for watching!
